        <mxCell id="eMQfO0gK09zNcYedJCLK-7" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;REPL launches a simulation daemon (using some config), which immediately returns references to the config variables (and possible state variables, for callback-ing).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;User can plug in own modifications of config.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Also provide some hook to run at each timestep.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8px;&quot;&gt;Visualizer only gets updates from core. Note that this flow is nice and linear, but necessitates core forwarding any config changes on to visualizer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Avenir;" vertex="1" parent="1">
